{"id":"0eddae8e-738e-4a34-aa49-0050fb20c79c","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"2799566421187683","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/workspace-runtime.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9481a505a5e21c17eb00079f1181f2904fb4bcc8","start":0,"end":75},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","RuntimeOptions",",","VirtualFS","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/almostnode","\""]},"context":{"after":"f13484ba92727e5c"}},"payload":{"text":"almostnode on the shared workspace, as a run has it (packages/tsval/README.md, *Modules*): the debug worker's (extensions/tsval/debug-worker.ts) — the\nworkspace's zen-fs, the deploy base, cwd and built-ins, the program's globals; a listening server answered one way\n(`answerServer`). What's passed in: the fs policy, where output goes,\nthe evaluator of the program's own files and its stand-ins. tsval's privilege (ARCHITECTURE.md, *Extension points* 2: the workspace's\nbuffer, mounted with zen-fs), with zenfs-vfs.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:27.749Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:27.749Z"}
